flowchart TD
    TS[Staf Tenant]
    TFE[POS Portal Tenant]
    API[API NestJS]
    DB[(MariaDB)]

    TS -->|1. buka tab POS| TFE
    TS -->|2. opsional: pindai QR pengunjung| TFE
    TFE -->|3. POST /qr-codes/resolve {code_data}| API
    API -->|4. kembalikan visitor_id| DB
    TS -->|5. pilih produk + qty + payment_method + paid| TFE
    TFE -->|6. POST /tenant-transactions/:tenant_id multipart detail_transactions string JSON| API
    API -->|7. hitung amount = sum(qty*harga), simpan detail| DB
    TS -->|8. ubah paid: PUT /tenant-transactions/:id| API
    TS -->|9. cetak nota (di sisi klien)| TFE

